      "category": "editor",
      "owner": "shellCached",
      "surface": "any",
      "label": "Follow-up behavior",
      "description": "What to do with messages you send while a turn is running. Queue waits for the turn to finish; Steer injects them mid-turn at the next tool batch or model step. Default: Queue.",
